  <AltText>
    Cute Artfight attack of our headmate, Hsiao Lyuhsien, from DaisybelltheCow. Lyuhsien is a cat-dragon hybrid with purple fur, dark purple scales, long dragon horns, and pinkish purple eyes. Zhe also has dark purple hair, with the scales running down the length of its tail being an even darker purple. Zhe is also sporting some cat whiskers. It is wearing a purple v-neck dress with a purple and blue sash, as well as a translucent purple skirt. Zhe is also wearing pride arm warmers and pride socks, which are the colours of the transgender and genderfluid flags. Around it is a dark-mode outline, which is a solid white outline so that the lines can be seen when viewed in dark mode.
  </AltText>
